WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.250
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.520 --> 01:42.036
[Episode 30]

3
01:42.036 --> 01:44.633
[Guanyin Pavilion]

4
03:04.960 --> 03:07.486
[Spirit Tablet of Eldest Brother Yu Ming Xuan]

5
03:26.560 --> 03:30.580
This was your brother's and my favorite drink.

6
03:32.440 --> 03:34.520
Your brother was picky about liquor.

7
03:34.520 --> 03:36.699
He'd only drink from one tavern.

8
03:49.080 --> 03:53.759
I know this is a lot to take in all at once.

9
03:54.599 --> 04:00.099
You can't bring yourself to believe he'd go this far for you.

10
04:02.479 --> 04:03.780
Jin,

11
04:06.620 --> 04:09.259
why did you come to Nanhuai?

12
04:12.135 --> 04:14.620
[Spirit Tablet of Eldest Brother Yu Ming Xuan]

13
04:16.560 --> 04:18.620
Your brother and I made a promise.

14
04:20.980 --> 04:22.180
I know.

15
04:26.379 --> 04:28.779
You never said it,

16
04:30.279 --> 04:34.420
but publicly you've been managing the Xiangxi Hotel for me.

17
04:35.360 --> 04:36.759
What few people know is

18
04:37.519 --> 04:42.660
that you've been running around funding reading societies.

19
04:44.480 --> 04:49.339
You're even sharper than your brother thought.

20
04:51.220 --> 04:53.759
Your brother and I joined a reading society in Japan.

21
04:54.459 --> 04:59.600
We sent all kinds of books back home and helped move supplies.

22
05:00.240 --> 05:02.524
But your brother came from a warlord family.

23
05:02.524 --> 05:07.120
That made things awkward for him, and people questioned him.

24
05:07.120 --> 05:11.160
He faced every doubt without ever wavering or giving up.

25
05:12.759 --> 05:16.300
When the reading society was suppressed later

26
05:17.480 --> 05:19.899
and when things looked most hopeless,

27
05:19.899 --> 05:26.220
your brother stepped up and led us through the hardest times.

28
05:29.420 --> 05:34.660
Then one day, he received a letter.

29
05:39.640 --> 05:41.180
What did it say?

30
05:44.620 --> 05:48.060
My mother says my father is gravely ill.

31
05:48.060 --> 05:51.220
I'll leave tomorrow morning.

32
05:54.800 --> 05:58.839
We finally managed to get the reading society going again.

33
05:58.839 --> 06:02.439
Are you really set on going back now?

34
06:05.879 --> 06:08.199
Nanhuai is my home.

35
06:08.199 --> 06:09.800
My family is there.

36
06:09.800 --> 06:14.079
And the Yu Army's future is tied to the survival of the people of Nanhuai.

37
06:14.079 --> 06:16.600
Things at home are chaotic right now.

38
06:16.600 --> 06:19.520
An army can't be left without its commander, not even for a day.

39
06:19.520 --> 06:21.320
I have to go back.

40
06:21.320 --> 06:23.357
But once you return,

41
06:23.357 --> 06:26.900
your father will make you take over the Yu Army.

42
06:28.000 --> 06:29.300
What will you choose?

43
06:31.120 --> 06:35.379
Whatever I choose, I will never give up our ideals.

44
06:35.379 --> 06:38.639
When you come back, we'll carry our ideals on together.

45
06:39.819 --> 06:43.639
My promise to you will never change.

46
06:48.839 --> 06:50.920
Throughout his life,

47
06:50.920 --> 06:53.079
he had too many people he wanted to protect

48
06:53.680 --> 06:58.560
and too many impossible choices to weigh.

49
06:59.240 --> 07:01.141
He tried to take care of everyone,

50
07:02.079 --> 07:06.019
yet in the end he never got to do

51
07:07.120 --> 07:09.220
the thing he wanted most.

52
07:13.579 --> 07:16.000
Your brother carried a fire inside him.

53
07:17.280 --> 07:22.240
It was lit when he studied in Japan, and it never went out.

54
07:22.240 --> 07:25.166
It wasn't the fire of ambition, of fighting for power and profit.

55
07:26.640 --> 07:29.250
It was a fire aimed at this rotting world,

56
07:29.250 --> 07:32.851
a fire that wanted to carve out a way

57
07:34.240 --> 07:36.341
for this land and its people to survive.

58
07:40.840 --> 07:42.939
He wrote to me once.

59
07:44.620 --> 07:46.006
"Zhong Fang,

60
07:47.439 --> 07:50.439
if you'd seen Chang Xuan training troops,

61
07:51.220 --> 07:57.213
you'd understand why I always say he was born to lead soldiers."

62
07:58.560 --> 08:03.560
He only ever wanted you to be stronger than he was,

63
08:04.280 --> 08:06.540
to lead the Yu Army

64
08:08.079 --> 08:13.279
and build the bright, just world he dreamed of.

65
08:16.319 --> 08:17.920
If he were still here,

66
08:19.420 --> 08:24.120
the last thing he'd want is to see you let guilt destroy you.

67
08:24.760 --> 08:30.720
I believe he shouldered the disgrace of that defeat for you

68
08:30.720 --> 08:34.400
and gave his life to keep you safe

69
08:34.400 --> 08:36.639
because he wanted you to keep going for him,

70
08:36.639 --> 08:41.720
and for the rest of us who still have that fire burning.

71
10:32.360 --> 10:37.841
All my life, I wanted to outdo him in everything.

72
10:39.520 --> 10:41.599
I wanted to fight him for anything he had.

73
10:43.560 --> 10:48.781
Everything I did was about surpassing him.

74
10:52.520 --> 10:54.500
But now I understand.

75
10:56.000 --> 10:58.600
Everything I fought so hard for...

76
11:00.920 --> 11:02.979
never mattered to him.

77
11:09.940 --> 11:11.240
Tell me,

78
11:13.740 --> 11:15.799
doesn't that make me a fool?

79
11:19.840 --> 11:21.499
I understand.

80
11:24.160 --> 11:29.520
Everything you did was just to earn their approval.

81
11:31.720 --> 11:34.480
And you never once held a grudge against him.

82
11:35.620 --> 11:36.919
Yes.

83
11:40.200 --> 11:42.899
I wanted their approval so badly.

84
11:45.860 --> 11:47.639
But in the end,

85
11:49.880 --> 11:52.021
the one who believed in me most

86
11:53.760 --> 11:55.680
and approved of me most

87
11:58.240 --> 12:00.100
was my brother.

88
12:03.120 --> 12:05.021
Jin was right.

89
12:07.040 --> 12:11.659
All his life, he had too many things to weigh.

90
12:13.200 --> 12:15.840
If he'd been just a little more selfish,

91
12:17.160 --> 12:19.900
he wouldn't have had to come back to Nanhuai for our father,

92
12:21.240 --> 12:27.039
put aside his dreams for the Yu family,

93
12:30.520 --> 12:35.780
or sacrifice himself for a useless little brother like me.

94
12:41.480 --> 12:43.600
Now I understand it all.

95
12:45.160 --> 12:47.040
I want to apologize to him,

96
12:49.960 --> 12:52.173
but I'm out of chances.

97
12:56.000 --> 12:57.920
He wouldn't blame you.

98
13:00.840 --> 13:02.799
You need to let him know

99
13:04.440 --> 13:06.480
he wasn't wrong about you.

100
13:27.279 --> 13:29.653
- Come on. - Have a drink.

101
13:36.000 --> 13:38.580
- Come on. - Come.

102
13:38.580 --> 13:41.460
Here, Miss Tao, we're honored you could join us today.

103
13:41.460 --> 13:42.820
- Yes. - Yes.

104
13:42.820 --> 13:44.580
- Let's hang out more often. - Exactly.

105
13:44.580 --> 13:46.220
Come out with us more often.

106
13:50.019 --> 13:53.320
Who is that? Why is he staring at you?

107
14:03.080 --> 14:05.200
You don't even know him?

108
14:05.200 --> 14:09.279
He's a big name,

109
14:09.279 --> 14:12.919
the new Director of Propaganda Department, Jiang.

110
14:14.120 --> 14:15.960
What a world we live in.

111
14:15.960 --> 14:18.300
Even a cripple can make it into the Propaganda Department.

112
14:20.640 --> 14:25.059
- Then he must be exceptionally talented. - That's exactly what's so impressive.

113
14:25.059 --> 14:28.593
A cripple, climbing that high.

114
14:35.299 --> 14:40.659
I'm in a good mood, so tonight's drinks are on me.

115
14:40.659 --> 14:42.159
- Everyone, let's thank Miss Tao! - Everyone, let's thank Miss Tao!

116
14:42.159 --> 14:44.760
- Thank you, Miss Tao! - Thank you, Miss Tao!

117
14:44.760 --> 14:46.839
- Come on, cheers! - Cheers!

118
14:59.840 --> 15:02.379
Miss, walking home alone at night?

119
15:02.379 --> 15:04.113
A girl like you could run into trouble.

120
15:04.840 --> 15:08.100
How about my buddy and I see you home?

121
15:08.100 --> 15:09.399
Get lost.

122
15:13.320 --> 15:15.303
You've got a temper, don't you?

123
15:15.303 --> 15:19.000
But that's just what we like.

124
15:19.000 --> 15:21.039
I told you to get lost. Are you deaf?

125
15:21.039 --> 15:22.039
You...

126
15:22.960 --> 15:24.299
You dare hit me?

127
15:24.299 --> 15:26.039
You're going to pay for that!

128
15:35.159 --> 15:36.600
You...

129
15:36.600 --> 15:39.013
Let go! Let go!

130
15:40.240 --> 15:41.899
You damn cripple! Who the hell are you?

131
15:41.899 --> 15:44.019
Sticking your nose in my business? Get him!

132
16:00.720 --> 16:01.840
Get lost!

133
16:01.840 --> 16:05.173
- You damn cripple! Just you wait. - Just you wait!

134
16:13.120 --> 16:14.460
You've had too much.

135
16:15.840 --> 16:17.440
Let me take you home.

136
16:18.680 --> 16:21.040
Who do you think you are?

137
16:21.040 --> 16:23.081
Since when is it your business?

138
16:25.159 --> 16:26.600
- Let go! - Don't make a scene.

139
16:26.600 --> 16:28.366
- Let me go! - That's enough.

140
16:29.340 --> 16:30.340
Jiang...

141
16:33.800 --> 16:34.800
You...

142
16:35.880 --> 16:37.280
Are you hurt?

143
16:41.800 --> 16:43.340
My car is right over there.

144
16:47.160 --> 16:48.760
Fine.

145
16:48.760 --> 16:53.520
Since you helped me today, I'll allow you to take me home.

146
18:13.455 --> 18:16.146
[Spirit Tablet of My Dear Son Yu Ming Xuan]

147
18:31.920 --> 18:33.193
You're back.

148
18:36.940 --> 18:38.240
I'm back.

149
19:25.859 --> 19:27.000
Father.

150
19:28.579 --> 19:30.140
Good to have you back.

151
19:32.880 --> 19:36.440
There's plenty waiting for you with the troops.

152
20:04.140 --> 20:06.200
Attention, soldiers!

153
20:06.200 --> 20:09.120
- Greetings, Deputy Commander Yu. - Greetings, Deputy Commander Yu.

154
20:09.120 --> 20:12.864
The border around Nanhuai City has been quiet lately.

155
20:12.864 --> 20:14.640
There's no war yet.

156
20:14.640 --> 20:16.637
But as soldiers,

157
20:16.637 --> 20:21.040
we have to stay ready at all times.

158
20:21.040 --> 20:26.735
The more sweat and hardship you put in on the training ground,

159
20:26.735 --> 20:32.477
the less blood you'll shed and the better your odds in battle.

160
20:32.477 --> 20:33.640
Understood?

161
20:33.640 --> 20:35.000
- Understood! - Understood!

162
20:48.333 --> 20:51.500
Chang Xuan, we've received a telegram.

163
20:51.500 --> 20:53.740
The Guangzhou National Government has taken control of all of Guangdong.

164
20:53.740 --> 20:55.280
Guangxi has pledged allegiance.

165
20:55.280 --> 20:59.279
The Southern Revolutionary Army has been formed and sent 100,000 troops into Hunan.

166
20:59.279 --> 21:01.559
Fighting has already broken out in Changsha.

167
21:01.559 --> 21:03.359
Commander Qu of the Qu Army called Headquarters.

168
21:03.359 --> 21:05.319
Said he had the Central Government's approval

169
21:05.319 --> 21:08.500
and wanted to join forces with us against the Revolutionary Army.

170
21:11.640 --> 21:13.499
Reply to them now.

171
21:14.080 --> 21:16.759
Bandit activity has been rampant around here lately.

172
21:16.759 --> 21:19.000
If we pull troops north,

173
21:19.000 --> 21:22.280
we could lose control of Nanhuai and put the Central Government at risk.

174
21:22.280 --> 21:24.060
So, you mean...

175
21:24.880 --> 21:30.050
For now, we focus on upgrading weapons

176
21:30.050 --> 21:32.050
and speeding up artillery production.

177
21:33.160 --> 21:35.719
Our job is to keep this region safe and its people secure,

178
21:36.600 --> 21:38.953
not to get pulled into a civil war.

179
21:52.960 --> 21:59.339
Most Chinese troops are equipped with either the German Mauser 1898

180
21:59.339 --> 22:03.320
or the Belgian FN M1924,

181
22:03.320 --> 22:04.984
both five-round magazines.

182
22:04.984 --> 22:10.593
But these semi-automatic rifles hold up to 20 rounds.

183
22:11.435 --> 22:13.740
When can we start mass production?

184
22:13.740 --> 22:15.960
We're planning a few more days of adjustments.

185
22:15.960 --> 22:20.133
If all goes well, the arsenal can begin mass production very soon.

186
22:21.119 --> 22:22.119
Good.

187
22:31.446 --> 22:32.759
There's one more thing.

188
22:32.759 --> 22:35.059
When using these automatic rifles,

189
22:35.059 --> 22:37.740
- you must be careful with the trigger... - What's wrong?

190
23:03.339 --> 23:07.299
Lady Ping Jun, there's a call for you.

191
23:07.299 --> 23:08.500
Coming.

192
23:12.960 --> 23:14.997
Walking more is good for you.

193
23:14.997 --> 23:20.666
It gets your blood flowing, and it'll make the birth easier.

194
23:21.560 --> 23:25.680
I just hate putting you and Min Ru out, having to keep me company every day.

195
23:25.680 --> 23:27.556
Don't be silly.

196
23:27.556 --> 23:29.700
We're all looking forward to this baby.

197
23:29.700 --> 23:32.779
Once it's born, this house will be full of life.

198
23:33.840 --> 23:35.440
Madam!

199
23:35.440 --> 23:37.684
- Madam! - What is it? Why the panic?

200
23:37.684 --> 23:39.240
It's terrible!

201
23:39.240 --> 23:41.280
Mount Changping Arsenal just exploded.

202
23:41.280 --> 23:42.839
The whole place came down.

203
23:42.839 --> 23:44.000
What about Chang Xuan?

204
23:44.000 --> 23:45.900
He was buried inside too.

205
23:45.900 --> 23:47.039
What?

206
23:48.920 --> 23:50.660
- Madam! - Mother!

207
23:53.259 --> 23:54.700
- Miss! - Get a doctor!

208
23:54.700 --> 23:56.280
- Get a doctor! - I'll get a car!

209
23:56.280 --> 23:57.746
I'll get a car!

210
24:00.374 --> 24:02.099
[Restricted Area. Authorized Personnel Only]

211
24:02.099 --> 24:03.593
Help!

212
24:04.539 --> 24:06.039
Clear the rubble!

213
24:21.000 --> 24:23.280
Move! Keep up! Keep up!

214
24:26.560 --> 24:27.699
Yu Chang Xuan!

215
24:28.520 --> 24:29.944
Yu Chang Xuan!

216
24:29.944 --> 24:32.000
Ping Jun, it's dangerous here. Stay outside.

217
24:32.000 --> 24:34.779
- Calm down! - Then tell me where he is!

218
24:41.759 --> 24:42.859
Ping Jun!

219
24:47.320 --> 24:48.506
Chang Xuan!

220
24:49.119 --> 24:50.500
Yu Chang Xuan!

221
24:51.560 --> 24:53.440
Chang Xuan, don't scare me.

222
24:53.440 --> 24:58.080
Chang Xuan, Chang Xuan, can you hear me?

223
24:58.080 --> 25:00.033
You'll be fine.

224
25:02.079 --> 25:05.160
You'll be fine, right?

225
25:05.160 --> 25:06.660
Chang Xuan!

226
25:08.039 --> 25:10.019
Chang Xuan, can you hear me?

227
25:10.019 --> 25:11.460
Chang Xuan!

228
25:16.680 --> 25:18.360
Chang Xuan!

229
25:22.440 --> 25:23.933
Chang Xuan!

230
25:25.720 --> 25:32.373
As long as you're safe, I'll say yes to anything.

231
25:36.019 --> 25:40.746
Let's stay together for the rest of our lives, all right?

232
25:47.040 --> 25:48.480
You can't take that back.

233
25:49.560 --> 25:51.400
Not for the rest of your life.

234
25:55.980 --> 25:57.380
Master Chang Xuan.

235
25:57.380 --> 25:58.680
Chang Xuan.

236
27:30.359 --> 27:32.140
You're alive!

237
27:34.599 --> 27:38.880
How could I die before I saw you?

238
27:39.680 --> 27:42.380
Is this the time for jokes?

239
27:46.859 --> 27:51.079
I heard every word you just said.

240
27:52.700 --> 27:54.039
Did you mean it?

241
28:00.520 --> 28:02.081
Chang Xuan,

242
28:04.599 --> 28:07.740
I thought I'd never see you again.

243
28:10.339 --> 28:15.339
That's when I understood. None of it matters anymore.

244
28:16.560 --> 28:20.280
Whether I remember the past doesn't matter.

245
28:21.539 --> 28:24.440
What matters is that we're together.

246
28:25.480 --> 28:29.100
What matters is our present and our future.

247
28:30.880 --> 28:33.219
Let's never be apart again.

248
28:55.380 --> 28:56.599
Ping Jun.

249
28:58.799 --> 29:00.279
I thought I'd go my whole life

250
29:02.680 --> 29:05.279
without ever hearing you say that.

251
29:11.500 --> 29:14.099
No matter what happens,

252
29:16.339 --> 29:18.380
I'm with you.

253
29:40.980 --> 29:43.320
Tanghulu!

254
29:45.560 --> 29:48.286
[Yu's Mansion]

255
29:56.720 --> 29:59.167
- Sweetheart. - Want me to get you a cushion?

256
30:03.180 --> 30:06.500
Look at his twitching little nose. So adorable.

257
30:07.299 --> 30:12.380
And those eyes and brows. They look exactly like Bing Wen's.

258
30:17.839 --> 30:19.779
He's only just opened his eyes,

259
30:19.779 --> 30:24.200
but I say he should grow up as pretty as Jin Xuan.

260
30:24.200 --> 30:28.664
Yes, Jin Xuan was a beautiful child.

261
30:28.664 --> 30:32.006
Bing Wen, have you thought of a name?

262
30:32.006 --> 30:34.120
I'm not very good at naming.

263
30:34.120 --> 30:35.633
I'll leave it to Jin Xuan.

264
30:36.579 --> 30:39.799
Father, why don't you name him?

265
30:42.359 --> 30:47.200
Yes. I think father should do the honors of naming the first grandchild in the family.

266
30:47.200 --> 30:51.140
- Alright. - Your father came up with names days ago.

267
30:51.140 --> 30:53.200
He wouldn't even let me look.

268
30:53.200 --> 30:55.440
Show them.

269
30:55.440 --> 30:56.680
Look at you.

270
30:56.680 --> 30:59.381
I was saving them for last.

271
31:01.700 --> 31:03.160
I've come up with three names.

272
31:03.160 --> 31:05.579
Father, let me see.

273
31:06.799 --> 31:10.500
Ze Tai, Ze An, Ze Ning.

274
31:11.099 --> 31:12.799
Jin Xuan, here you are.

275
31:12.799 --> 31:14.359
Pick the one you like.

276
31:18.599 --> 31:20.380
It's the Yu family's child.

277
31:21.000 --> 31:22.460
The child's surname is Yu!

278
31:23.180 --> 31:25.079
What does it have to do with you?

279
31:31.400 --> 31:33.200
Ze Ning.

280
31:33.200 --> 31:35.360
Yu Ze Ning.

281
31:35.360 --> 31:39.120
Deep blessings, peace, and harmony.

282
31:40.500 --> 31:42.040
I like this one.

283
31:42.040 --> 31:46.864
Good. Then he'll be Yu Ze Ning.

284
31:46.864 --> 31:49.380
- Yes. - Yu Ze Ning.

285
31:49.380 --> 31:50.700
Ze Ning.

286
31:51.800 --> 31:53.863
Ping Jun, hold him.

287
31:53.863 --> 31:55.840
Get some of Jin Xuan's good luck.

288
32:19.500 --> 32:21.900
Look how much Ping Jun loves children.

289
32:21.900 --> 32:23.579
She likes him so much.

290
32:23.579 --> 32:26.619
Chang Xuan, you'd better get a move on.

291
32:28.240 --> 32:29.380
Exactly.

292
32:29.380 --> 32:32.720
When is it your turn to give us some good news?

293
32:37.360 --> 32:39.280
Don't tease us.

294
32:39.280 --> 32:42.540
We haven't even finished celebrating this one yet,

295
32:43.600 --> 32:44.919
right, Ze Ning?

296
32:54.519 --> 32:58.720
Never thought Yu Chang Xuan would be this hard to kill.

297
32:58.720 --> 33:02.420
The whole workshop collapsed, and he still managed to survive.

298
33:02.420 --> 33:05.800
That German engineer, reckless and hungry for credit,

299
33:05.800 --> 33:09.960
used gunpowder that hadn't passed final testing without approval.

300
33:09.960 --> 33:13.880
If anything, the explosion only gave Yu Chang Xuan more reason

301
33:13.880 --> 33:16.086
to tighten oversight at the arsenal.

302
33:16.086 --> 33:19.799
He hasn't slowed down a bit.

303
33:23.079 --> 33:25.200
What's his stance on the Revolutionary Army?

304
33:28.000 --> 33:33.240
Based on the orders he issued, he has no interest in a civil war.

305
33:33.240 --> 33:36.360
He's trying to pull away from the Central Government.

306
33:38.779 --> 33:41.680
The Central Government won't stand for him building his own army.

307
33:43.839 --> 33:46.680
I've strengthened ties with Chu Wen Fu.

308
33:46.680 --> 33:49.539
Now we just wait for the right moment.

309
33:52.400 --> 33:58.579
That moment is us joining forces against Yu Chang Xuan.

310
33:59.180 --> 34:00.640
When it's done,

311
34:01.900 --> 34:03.599
the Yu Army's best troops,

312
34:04.200 --> 34:05.980
Nanhuai's wealth,

313
34:06.700 --> 34:09.840
and the heads of Yu Zhong Quan and his son...

314
34:09.840 --> 34:11.673
We each get our share.

315
34:20.139 --> 34:22.340
The north-south situation is delicate right now.

316
34:22.340 --> 34:24.040
And the Central Government invites you

317
34:24.040 --> 34:26.680
to this military-political coordination meeting at this point.

318
34:28.240 --> 34:31.541
Isn't that obviously a test of where you stand on the Revolutionary Army?

319
34:32.269 --> 34:33.760
Send a telegram back to them.

320
34:33.760 --> 34:36.619
Tell them we're clearing out the remaining bandits in the western hills.

321
34:36.619 --> 34:39.980
We'll have Chief Advisor Gu take two advisors to the meeting

322
34:39.980 --> 34:42.639
and bring our counter-bandit records for the past three years.

323
34:45.440 --> 34:47.719
And if they insist on a statement from you?

324
34:49.039 --> 34:53.440
Then have Chief Advisor Gu raise the military supply issue with them on the spot.

325
34:53.440 --> 34:56.739
Tell them the Yu Army is short on funds and needs equipment repairs.

326
34:56.739 --> 35:00.346
We're worn down by bandits and urgently need reinforcements.

327
35:01.613 --> 35:03.480
If they really want a statement from me,

328
35:03.480 --> 35:06.280
they can start by helping me solve these pressing problems.

329
35:25.579 --> 35:28.539
Lady Ping Jun, Lady Ping Jun.

330
35:30.240 --> 35:33.120
Lady Ping Jun, Master Chang Xuan sent me to pick you up.

331
35:33.120 --> 35:35.646
Pick me up? Where to?

332
35:35.646 --> 35:38.039
He didn't tell me. He only said to make sure you come.

333
35:38.039 --> 35:40.139
The car's already waiting outside.

334
36:03.400 --> 36:04.699
Chang Xuan?

335
36:07.219 --> 36:08.460
Chang Xuan?

336
36:18.480 --> 36:20.873
All right, stop messing around.

337
36:20.873 --> 36:22.480
Come with me.

338
36:22.480 --> 36:23.619
Where are we going?

339
36:23.619 --> 36:25.100
You'll see.

340
37:48.040 --> 37:51.720
Ping Jun, do you know what I was thinking

341
37:51.720 --> 37:55.880
when I was buried in the rubble after the explosion?

342
37:57.219 --> 37:58.519
I was thinking,

343
37:59.800 --> 38:01.234
if I died,

344
38:02.480 --> 38:05.393
would you turn around and marry another man?

345
38:08.800 --> 38:10.420
Of course.

346
38:10.420 --> 38:13.480
I'll find myself a good husband right away.

347
38:21.639 --> 38:23.980
Then I definitely can't give you that chance.

348
38:25.000 --> 38:27.100
I'm going to lock you down for good.

349
38:33.280 --> 38:34.580
Ping Jun,

350
38:37.280 --> 38:39.113
last time you were in a coma,

351
38:40.119 --> 38:45.880
so today... I want to propose to you again.

352
38:55.280 --> 38:59.539
Ye Ping Jun, will you marry me?

353
39:07.480 --> 39:10.540
When I woke up from the coma,

354
39:11.679 --> 39:17.780
everything seemed strange and hazy.

355
39:18.840 --> 39:23.730
But you encouraged me, taught me to walk again,

356
39:23.730 --> 39:29.190
and stayed by my side day and night.

357
39:31.719 --> 39:34.139
When I was framed,

358
39:35.380 --> 39:38.079
you didn't hesitate to believe in me.

359
39:40.079 --> 39:42.440
When I was in danger,

360
39:43.320 --> 39:46.380
you came to protect me without a second thought.

361
39:46.380 --> 39:48.320
I've even wondered

362
39:49.980 --> 39:55.139
if my feelings for you were just gratitude.

363
39:56.400 --> 39:58.960
But after everything we've been through,

364
39:59.840 --> 40:02.041
I finally understand.

365
40:06.600 --> 40:07.980
Yu Chang Xuan,

366
40:14.160 --> 40:16.761
I want to spend the rest of my life with you.

367
40:23.880 --> 40:25.753
Then you'd better be sure.

368
40:26.560 --> 40:28.013
Once you say yes,

369
40:29.340 --> 40:31.000
I will never,

370
40:32.280 --> 40:34.260
never let you go.

371
40:36.539 --> 40:39.139
Then you'd better be sure too.

372
40:39.139 --> 40:41.139
Once I say yes,

373
40:42.239 --> 40:46.099
Yu Chang Xuan, there's no one else but me from now on.

374
40:46.099 --> 40:48.500
No more wandering eyes.

375
40:53.640 --> 40:55.001
In my heart,

376
40:55.840 --> 40:59.940
from the very beginning, there has only ever been you.

377
41:07.719 --> 41:09.780
Let this ring be my promise.

378
41:09.780 --> 41:11.340
For the rest of our lives,

379
41:13.340 --> 41:17.739
I'll cherish every day and night, every season, and every year we share.

380
41:27.039 --> 41:29.179
And let this ring be my promise.

381
41:29.179 --> 41:31.119
For the rest of our lives,

382
41:31.119 --> 41:35.420
I will treat you with all my heart, always by your side,

383
41:38.280 --> 41:40.019
and grow old with you.

384
46:04.600 --> 46:07.766
Good morning, my lady.

385
46:37.480 --> 46:39.140
I'll be waiting for you at home.

386
46:40.400 --> 46:42.039
I'll be back early.
